      "category": "Trap & Edge Case",
      "prompt": "A composite solid consists of a right circular cylinder with radius $r = 6$ and height $h = 8$, capped at one end with a hemispherical dome of the same radius $r = 6$. A student calculates the total exterior surface area as shown. Which line contains the FIRST error?",
